  "id": "sum-of-squared-errors",
  "term": "sum of squared errors",
  "definition": "Sum of squared errors is a statistical quantity used in research methods. In linear regression, it adds up the squared differences between observed values and predicted values; in analysis of variance, it reflects the summed squared deviations associated with error within the design.",
